{"type":"text","timestamp":1785121940862,"sessionID":"ses_05e71d9b9ffeT0NKZrnZDeZgaN","part":{"id":"prt_fa18f046a001XwXES0zbg0m7Ez","messageID":"msg_fa18ef8e400112zYrITeqi043x","sessionID":"ses_05e71d9b9ffeT0NKZrnZDeZgaN","type":"text","text":"The ranking of eye colors for Marvel Comics superheroes by popularity (most common first):\n\n| Rank | Eye Color | Count |\n|------|-----------|-------|\n| 1 | Blue | 126 |\n| 2 | Brown | 89 |\n| 3 | No Colour | 47 |\n| 4 | Green | 40 |\n| 5 | Red | 31 |\n| 6 | Yellow | 13 |\n| 7 | White | 12 |\n| 8 | Black | 11 |\n| 9 | Grey | 4 |\n| 10 | Hazel | 3 |\n| 11 | Purple | 2 |\n| 12 | Gold | 2 |\n| 13 | Yellow/Blue | 1 |\n| 14 | White/Red | 1 |\n| 15 | Violet | 1 |\n| 16 | Silver | 1 |\n| 17 | Green/Blue | 1 |\n| 18 | Blue/White | 1 |\n| 19 | Amber | 1 |\n\n**Blue** is the most common eye color among Marvel Comics superheroes with 126 heroes, followed by **Brown** (89) and **No Colour** (47).\n\nFinal Answer: Blue (126), Brown (89), No Colour (47), Green (40), Red (31), Yellow (13), White (12), Black (11), Grey (4), Hazel (3), Purple (2), Gold (2), Yellow/Blue (1), White/Red (1), Violet (1), Silver (1), Green/Blue (1), Blue/White (1), Amber (1)\nEvidence SQL: SELECT c.colour AS eye_color, COUNT(s.id) AS superhero_count FROM superhero s JOIN publisher p ON s.publisher_id = p.id JOIN colour c ON s.eye_colour_id = c.id WHERE p.publisher_name = 'Marvel Comics' GROUP BY c.colour ORDER BY superhero_count DESC","time":{"start":1785121932394,"end":1785121940840}}}
